  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`function LLEvents.changed(change)
    --  note that it's & and not &&... it's bitwise!
    if bit32.btest(change, CHANGED_REGION_START) then
        local owner = ll.GetOwner()
        local region = ll.GetRegionName()
        ll.InstantMessage(owner, "Region '" .. region .. "' has restarted.")
    end
end
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default
{
    changed(integer change)
    {
    //  note that it's & and not &&... it's bitwise!
        if (change & CHANGED_REGION_START)
        {
            key owner = llGetOwner();
            string region = llGetRegionName();
            llInstantMessage(owner, "Region '" + region + "' has restarted.");
        }
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
  <h2>Notes</h2>
  <p>When a region is (re)started all <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Http_request" target="_blank">HTTP server</a> URLs are automatically released and invalidated.</p>
